      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Bridge events: the emitter\n\nThis graph holds a **Temperature** and an **export** that offers its change event.\n\n1. Open the **listener** beside this graph (it imports this one).\n2. Change the Temperature here.\n3. The listener's Property changes: its own Method ran, in its own graph.\n\nThe export lists what is offered: only the Temperature changing. Nothing else here is heard over there."
        },
        "interfaceContract": {
          "version": 1,
          "receivesViewContent": true
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "bridge-events-emitter",
          "nodeId": "bridge-events-emitter-landing"
        }
